  "instructions": [
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and stir fry until fragrant.",
    "Add the green curry paste and stir fry for 1 minute.",
    "Add the tofu and stir gently to combine.",
    "Add the soy sauce, rice vinegar, and water, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped scallions and serve.",
    "Serve hot over steamed rice or noodles."
